		"description": "# 🏛️ SIH 2026 - Tender Verification Platform API Documentation\n\nOfficial REST API Specification for both **Officer Module** (DigiLocker Identity Verification, Email OTP, JWT) and **Bidder Module** (PAN, GSTIN, Udyam MSME verification, Email OTP, Bidder Profile Management).\n\n### 🚀 Base URL\n`http://localhost:8080`\n\n### 🔐 Authentication\n- Bearer Token in `Authorization: Bearer <JWT_TOKEN>` header for protected endpoints.\n- Automated collection scripts capture tokens into `{{officer_token}}` and `{{bidder_token}}`.",
